AI Video Studio Pro - 100% VERIFIED FULL SPECIFICATION PROMPT
=====================================================================
Build a personal-use video & audio editing app named "AI Video Studio Pro" using
Flutter 3.24.5 (stable) for Android ONLY. Target: single user, no Play Store, no login/signup, no PWA.

=== 1. PROJECT STRUCTURE & FILES ===
You must generate all required production-ready Flutter and Android configuration files:

- pubspec.yaml
- android/build.gradle
- android/app/build.gradle
- android/settings.gradle
- android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
- .github/workflows/build.yml
- lib/main.dart
- lib/screens/home_screen.dart
- lib/screens/editor_screen.dart
- lib/screens/resolution_converter_screen.dart
- lib/screens/audio_editor_screen.dart
- lib/screens/export_screen.dart
