=== 2. PUBSPEC.YAML SPECIFICATION ===
name: ai_video_studio_pro
description: "A personal-use Android video and audio editing app powered by Flutter and FFmpeg."
publish_to: 'none'
version: 1.0.0+1

environment:
  sdk: '>=3.5.0 <4.0.0'

dependencies:
  flutter:
    sdk: flutter

  # File management & storage
  file_picker: ^8.1.2
  media_store_plus: ^1.0.3
  path_provider: ^2.1.2
  shared_preferences: ^2.2.2
  permission_handler: ^11.3.0

  # Video processing & AI
  ffmpeg_kit_flutter_new_full_gpl: ^1.0.0
  video_player: ^2.8.6
  google_mlkit_selfie_segmentation: ^0.13.0
  google_generative_ai: ^0.4.6

  # Background processing
  flutter_background_service: ^5.0.9

dev_dependencies:
  flutter_test:
    sdk: flutter
  flutter_lints: ^4.0.0

flutter:
  uses-material-design: true

=== 3. ANDROID CONFIGURATION ===
A. Root android/build.gradle:
   Include google() and mavenCentral() in buildscript and allprojects repositories.
   Dependencies:
   - classpath 'com.android.tools.build:gradle:8.1.0'
   - classpath 'org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-gradle-plugin:1.9.22'

B. android/app/build.gradle:
   - namespace "com.example.ai_video_studio_pro"
   - compileSdkVersion 34
   - defaultConfig:
     - applicationId "com.example.ai_video_studio_pro"
     - minSdkVersion 24
     - targetSdkVersion 34
     - versionCode 1
     - versionName "1.0.0"
     - ndkVersion "25.1.8937393"
   - compileOptions:
     - sourceCompatibility JavaVersion.VERSION_17
     - targetCompatibility JavaVersion.VERSION_17
   - kotlinOptions:
     - jvmTarget = '17'

C. android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml:
   Permissions:
   - READ_MEDIA_VIDEO
   - READ_MEDIA_AUDIO
   - READ_MEDIA_IMAGES
   - INTERNET
   - RECORD_AUDIO
   - CAMERA
   - FOREGROUND_SERVICE
   - FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROCESSING
   - POST_NOTIFICATIONS
   - WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE (maxSdkVersion="28")

   Foreground Service Entry:
   <service
       android:name="id.flutter.flutter_background_service.BackgroundService"
       android:foregroundServiceType="mediaProcessing"
       android:exported="false" />

=== 4. GITHUB ACTIONS WORKFLOW (.github/workflows/build.yml) ===
name: Build Android APK
on: workflow_dispatch

jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-java@v4
        with:
          distribution: 'temurin'
          java-version: '17'
      - uses: subosito/flutter-action@v2
        with:
          flutter-version: '3.24.5'
          channel: 'stable'
      - run: flutter pub get
      - run: flutter build apk --release
      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with:
          name: AI-Video-Studio-Pro-APK
          path: build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk

=== 5. CORE FEATURES & EXPORT ENGINE ===
1. UI: CapCut-style dark Material 3 interface with bottom navigation (Home, Projects, AI Tools, Settings).
2. Offline/Online Badging:
   - Offline features: Green "Offline Mode" badge.
   - Gemini features: Blue "Online Required" badge.
3. AI Feature Handling:
   - google_generative_ai is used ONLY for text and image content analysis.
   - For paid features (Change Dress, Hairstyle, Deblur, Watermark Removal), show dialog:
     "This feature requires a paid API key (Imagen 3 - not available in free tier). Coming soon."
4. Dual Codec Smart Export System (Export Screen):
   - TAB A: "YouTube Mode (h264 - YouTube Recommended)"
     Command template: -c:v libx264 -crf 23 -preset medium -c:a aac -b:a 128k
   - TAB B: "Super Saver Mode (h265 - 1MB/min) - Save Storage"
     Command template: -c:v libx265 -crf 28 -preset fast -c:a aac -b:a 64k
   - Displays real-time estimated file sizes comparing both modes.
5. Media Management: Save outputs to device storage via media_store_plus and local app directory via path_provider.

